Subject: [PATCH 19/20] WIP fix-juice-6: narrow forms for 280 px, two test
 fixes, BP-2 accepts any pay place first, before screenshots

The tax rows' shortest names fit 128 px with the largest yearly amounts (measured in the app's
font); the family line gets a shorter form; Italy's INPS row no longer says social security; the
US row check's regex; Fix3 app BP-2 lets the graded pay place lead (J-5). Before screenshots from
the persona-wave build (cycle-beta7-dist).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
